        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>戏曲剧种与科举考试笔记</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f7f5ef;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    color: #1a2a4a;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 14px 22px 26px 26px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #f7f5ef;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n        to bottom,\n        transparent 0px,\n        transparent 40px,\n        #e6e2d6 40px,\n        #e6e2d6 41px\n    );\n  }\n  .line {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .indent1 {\n    margin-left: 14px;\n  }\n  .genre {\n    display: inline-block;\n    min-width: 3.6em;\n  }\n  /* 荧光笔标记（标题） */\n  .hl {\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 8%, #f2a8d8 8%, #f2a8d8 92%, transparent 92%);\n    color: #c81e78;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .hl-blue {\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 15%, #a8d8f2 15%, #a8d8f2 95%, transparent 95%);\n  }\n  .hl-pink-word {\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 15%, #f4b6dc 15%, #f4b6dc 95%, transparent 95%);\n  }\n  /* 红圈标注 */\n  .circle {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.6px solid #d0202a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n    color: #d0202a;\n  }\n  .circle-plain {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.6px solid #d0202a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .uline {\n    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #d0202a;\n  }\n  h2.sec {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin: 26px 0 6px 0;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .body-line {\n    margin-left: 12px;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin-left: 12px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .item p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"line indent1\"><span class=\"genre\">黄梅戏</span> 安徽 《天仙配》《女驸马》</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent1\"><span class=\"genre\">越剧</span> 浙江 《梁山伯与祝英台》</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent1\"><span class=\"circle\">评剧</span> 河北 《刘巧儿》《杨三姐告状》</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent1\"><span class=\"genre\">昆曲</span> 苏州昆山 《牡丹亭》《桃花扇》《长生殿》</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent1\"><span class=\"genre\">秦腔</span> 陕西 《和氏璧》《长坂坡》</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent1\"><span class=\"genre\">花鼓戏</span> <span class=\"hl-blue\">湖南</span> 《刘海砍樵》《打铜锣》《补锅》</div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"sec\"><span class=\"hl\">六、我国四大古典戏剧</span></h2>\n  <div class=\"body-line\">《西厢记》《牡丹亭》《长生殿》《桃花扇》</div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"sec\"><span class=\"hl\">七、节气歌</span></h2>\n  <div class=\"body-line\"><span class=\"circle\">春</span>雨惊春清谷天 <span class=\"circle\">夏</span>满芒夏暑相连</div>\n  <div class=\"body-line\"><span class=\"hl-pink-word\">秋</span>处露<span class=\"circle\">秋</span>寒霜降 冬雪雪<span class=\"circle\">冬</span>小大寒</div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"sec\"><span class=\"hl\">八、科举考试</span></h2>\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <p>分为四级：院试-乡试-会试-殿试（口诀：<span class=\"hl-pink-word uline\">愿想会点</span>）</p>\n    <p>1、院试：考中的叫秀才，一般可称相公</p>\n    <p>2、乡试：每隔 3 年在省城举行一次，参考者为秀才，</p>\n    <p>考中的为举人。举人第一名称解元，二至十名亚元。</p>\n    <p>3、会试：第二年春天举人参加。考中称贡士，第一</p>\n    <p>名称会元。</p>\n    <p>4、殿试：贡士参加，殿试分三甲录取，一甲赐进士</p>\n    <p>及第，二甲赐进士出身，三甲赐同进士出身。殿试</p>\n    <p>第一名状元，第二名榜眼，第三名探花。</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
